  "worked_solution": "We can evaluate this limit using direct substitution, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to 2}\\frac{{3}^{x}+5}{{2}^{x}-3} & =\\frac{{lim}_{x\\to 2}({3}^{x}+5)}{{lim}_{x\\to 2}({2}^{x}-3)} \\\\  & =\\frac{{3}^{2}+5}{{2}^{2}-3} \\\\  & =\\frac{9+5}{4-3} \\\\  & =\\frac{14}{1} \\\\  & =14\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
